-Deberíamos enviarle una bomba nuclear...

245
00:16:43,712 --> 00:16:44,752
-Señor...
-...acabar con él.

246
00:16:44,838 --> 00:16:47,338
-¿Entiende?
-Lo sentimos, señor. Disculpe.

247
00:16:47,424 --> 00:16:48,514
Amigo.

248
00:16:48,591 --> 00:16:51,471
